nux</category><category>ai-coding</category></item><item><title></title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://daily.dev/posts/q50xvvrml</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/q50XVVrml</guid><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 07:08:09 GMT</pubDate><author>Jacob B. Bonde</author><itunes:image href="https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010"></itunes:image><category>ai</category><category>openai</category><category>nvidia</category><category>gpu</category></item><item><title></title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://daily.dev/posts/co05u7rpx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/cO05U7rpX</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 14:54:33 GMT</pubDate><author>Andrea Debernardi</author><itunes:image href="https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010"></itunes:image><category>postgresql</category></item><item><title>No jobs for vibe coders. Sorry</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--1KxV4ohY--/f_auto/v1722860400/public/Placeholder%2007&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://daily.dev/posts/no-jobs-for-vibe-coders-sorry-6mxitaboo</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://api.daily.dev/r/6MXITaBoO</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 16:31:42 GMT</pubDate><author>Dennis Ivy</author><itunes:image href="https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--1KxV4ohY--/f_auto/v1722860400/public/Placeholder%2007"></itunes:image><category>career</category><category>interview</category><category>ai-coding</category><category>vibe-coding</category></item><